CONFIRMEDTESTKEY

tls_skip_verify.key and tls_skip_verify.pem are test-only self-signed server
credentials for untrusted.example.com. They are not production credentials.
Generate them with:

openssl req -x509 -newkey rsa:2048 -nodes \
  -keyout tls_skip_verify.key -out tls_skip_verify.pem -days 36500 \
  -subj '/CN=untrusted.example.com' -addext 'subjectAltName=DNS:untrusted.example.com'
